{"id":"9f2b96b6284f9981","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-relativized-turing-degree.md","title":"Relativized Turing Degree","display":"df-relativized-turing-degree — Relativized Turing Degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-relativized-turing-degree","aliases":["58-df-relativized-turing-degree"],"display":"df-relativized-turing-degree — Relativized Turing Degree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-relativized-turing-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-relativized-turing-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relativized-turing-degree — Relativized Turing Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(X\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a> 给出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OracleComputation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{OracleComputation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T^A\">\\(\\leq_T^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[B]_T^A\">\\([B]_T^A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_T(A)\">\\(\\mathcal D_T(A)\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OracleComputation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(y,e,X,x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}(y,e,X,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OracleComputation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(y,e,X,x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}(y,e,X,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}turing\\text{-}join} \\vdash A\\oplus B\\coloneqq\\{2n:n\\in A\\}\\cup\\{2n+1:n\\in B\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}turing\\text{-}join} \\vdash A\\oplus B\\coloneqq\\{2n:n\\in A\\}\\cup\\{2n+1:n\\in B\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash\nC\\leq_T^A B\\leftrightarrow A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(x\\in C\\land\\mathrm{OracleComputation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(1,e,A\\oplus B,x)\\bigr)\n\\lor\\bigl(x\\notin C\\land\\mathrm{OracleComputation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(0,e,A\\oplus B,x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash\nC\\leq_T^A B\\leftrightarrow A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(x\\in C\\land\\mathrm{OracleComputation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(1,e,A\\oplus B,x)\\bigr)\n\\lor\\bigl(x\\notin C\\land\\mathrm{OracleComputation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(0,e,A\\oplus B,x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash [B]_T^A\\coloneqq\\{C\\subseteq\\omega\\mid C\\leq_T^A B\\land B\\leq_T^A C\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash [B]_T^A\\coloneqq\\{C\\subseteq\\omega\\mid C\\leq_T^A B\\land B\\leq_T^A C\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash \\mathcal D_T(A)\\coloneqq\\{[B]_T^A\\mid B\\subseteq\\omega\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash \\mathcal D_T(A)\\coloneqq\\{[B]_T^A\\mid B\\subseteq\\omega\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原四元计算关系名称中的下标及参数顺序；其语义现在是内部有限执行关系，而非未解释的元语言断言。</li>\n<li>偶奇列合并及相对化总特征函数条件保持不变。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"